    {
      "slug": "the-squid-are-in",
      "title": "The squid are in",
      "date": "2026-10-08",
      "categories": [
        "harbour"
      ],
      "tags": [
        "squid",
        "boats"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/sea-view.webp",
      "excerpt": "The autumn squid arrived early this year; they are on the dinner trays from this week.",
      "content": "<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The boats came back at dawn on Tuesday with the first squid of the autumn. Ken grills them with salt and a little soy over charcoal.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>They stay on the dinner tray until the water cools in November.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->"
    },
    {
      "slug": "a-new-bicycle-rack",
      "title": "A new bicycle rack by the door",
      "date": "2026-09-27",
      "categories": [
        "island-days"
      ],
      "tags": [
        "cycling"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/cycling-path.webp",
      "excerpt": "Six electric bicycles now wait by the door, with helmets and a map of the coast road.",
      "content": "<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We replaced the old rack with a cedar one built by a neighbour. There are six electric bicycles now, each with a basket and a helmet.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Ask at the desk for the map: it marks the lighthouse, the salt pans and the shell beach.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->"
    },
    {
      "slug": "what-we-serve-at-dinner",
      "title": "What we serve at dinner",
      "date": "2026-09-14",
      "categories": [
        "the-inn"
      ],
      "tags": [
        "dinner",
        "boats"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/dinner-cutout.webp",
      "excerpt": "A tray of what the boats brought in: grilled fish, sashimi, island rice and a clam miso.",
      "content": "<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Dinner is at half past six in the front room. The tray changes with the boats, but there is always grilled fish, sashimi and rice from the terraces above the harbour.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Tell us about allergies when you book and we will plan around them.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->"
    },
    {
      "slug": "airing-the-futons",
      "title": "Airing the futons",
      "date": "2026-08-30",
      "categories": [
        "the-inn"
      ],
      "tags": [
        "rooms"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/room-tatami.webp",
      "excerpt": "On sunny mornings every futon goes out on the rail facing the sea.",
      "content": "<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The sea wind does most of the work. By three o’clock the futons are back in the cupboards, smelling of sun and salt.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>It is the first thing guests notice when they slide the door open.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->"
    }
